    {"what":"state.hill","why":"DIVERGENCE: harness, not the engine: from step 14 the only advert is site 8 and the engine adopts it silently (owner 1, progress 100, setStations replaces the station list); the Python runner only adds the listed sites, so the stage keeps site 11 latched (owner 2, progress 4). brx5 fixes the runner, then this entry goes."},
